# Vercel auto-detects a Python project from requirements.txt at the root, builds
# a serverless function, finds no entrypoint and 502s every page. Excluding the
# pipeline files is what keeps this a plain static deploy. Verified failure mode
# on topchallenger.ae; do not remove without testing a preview first.
requirements.txt
Dockerfile
railway.json
scripts/
drafts/
research/
logs/
docs/
_redirects
netlify.toml
.netlify/
keywords.csv
*.md
.gsc-oauth.json

# Bing Webmaster API key (scripts/bing_client.py). Gitignored too; must never ship.
.bing-api.json

# Migration records, 2026-10-23. Kept in the repo as history (the Netlify to
# Vercel URL baseline and the pre-cutover DNS dump), never served.
URL-BASELINE-PRE-MIGRATION.json
DNS-PRE-CUTOVER.txt
